Error [jet.InvalidSchedule]: This daily schedule isn't a plain `"HH:MM"` time
  --> tests/ui/schedule_bad_wallclock_format.jet:3:13
    |
  3 | #Job(every: "3:00") prune_sessions: fn() {
    |             ^^^^^^
 Why: A wall-clock trigger is exactly two digits, a colon, and two digits — 24h time, no seconds, no timezone.
 Fix: Write a fixed daily time like `#Job(every: "03:00")`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0926
